{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:6Swidux11RetryPolicyV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RetryPolicy"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"title":"RetryPolicy"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forever"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" matters just as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app can see rather than a silence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/retrypolicy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","